RCL1 complex allowing the interaction of RCL1 with its RNA substrate. Required for RCL1 import into the nucleus."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}